{"answer_text":"Good support reporting covers first-response time, resolution time, backlog and CSAT, ideally by channel. Strong options:\n\n**Brightdesk Helpdesk**\nStrong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated.\n\n**Calmline**\nThe most pleasant shared inbox for small support teams; reporting is basic.\n\n**Northwind CRM Service Desk**\nA full suite with a service desk included in the higher tiers.\n\nIf support is your main workflow, go with Brightdesk; otherwise Calmline keeps things simpler.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50fd-7719-948a-76baaa8b1e29","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:14.050Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["customer support metrics dashboard","support software reporting csat","help desk reporting comparison"],"latency_ms":12720,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[125,135],[443,453]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[218,226]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[308,321]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or critici